    <p>Sharing my thoughts on technology, development tips, and personal experiences.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Getting Started with Web Development</h3>
        <p>As a beginner, the world of web development can seem overwhelming. Here's my journey from HTML basics to building full-stack applications.</p>
        <small>Date: 2023-10-01</small>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Why I Love Laravel</h3>
        <p>Laravel has been a game-changer for my PHP projects. Its elegant syntax and powerful features make development enjoyable and efficient.</p>
        <small>Date: 2023-09-15</small>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Balancing Code and Life</h3>
        <p>Programming is my passion, but maintaining work-life balance is crucial. Here are some tips I've learned along the way.</p>
        <small>Date: 2023-08-20</small>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-color);">To add more posts, copy a card div and update the title, content, and date.</p>
  </section>

  <footer style="background-color: var(--secondary-bg); padding: 20px 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
